graph TD
  %% Internet Gateway
  IGW[Internet Gateway (IGW)]

  %% Publiczne podsieci i ich tablica routingu
  subgraph Public Subnets (public route table)
    direction LR
    PubRT[Public Route Table<br/>route 0.0.0.0/0 → IGW]
    PubSubnet1[Public Subnet 1]
    PubSubnet2[Public Subnet 2]
    PubRT --> PubSubnet1
    PubRT --> PubSubnet2
  end

  %% Prywatne podsieci i ich tablice routingu (po jednej na AZ)
  subgraph Private Subnets (private route tables, no internet yet)
    direction LR
    PrivRT1[Private Route Table AZ1<br/>local routes only]
    PrivRT2[Private Route Table AZ2<br/>local routes only]
    PrivSubnet1[Private Subnet 1 (AZ1)]
    PrivSubnet2[Private Subnet 2 (AZ2)]
    PrivRT1 --> PrivSubnet1
    PrivRT2 --> PrivSubnet2
  end

  %% Połączenie publicznej tablicy do IGW
  IGW --> PubRT
